data: {"type":"tool-output-available","toolCallId":"call_1","output":{"hits":[{"id":"project-retrieval","title":"Hybrid retrieval","category":"project","url":"https://github.com/avunculargroup/business-mono","text":"The knowledge base uses hybrid search rather than a single vector lookup: pgvector (HNSW) similarity, graph traversal across knowledge connections, and Postgres full-text search, so each query uses the method that fits it. Embeddings are generated with OpenAI text-embedding-3-small at 1536 dimensions.","score":1},{"id":"skills-llm","title":"LLM engineering skills","category":"skills","url":"https://github.com/avunculargroup/business-mono","text":"On the LLM side he builds agent orchestration, retrieval-augmented generation, hybrid search, tool use and human-in-the-loop control flow, and treats evals as first-class, gated in CI. His production agent work is built on Mastra; he has also prototyped pipelines with Flowise and LangChain.","score":0.6922},{"id":"faq-production","title":"Has he shipped to production?","category":"faq","url":"https://github.com/avunculargroup/business-mono","text":"Yes. business-mono is a live, deployed multi-agent system running real operations, not a demo — built and shipped solo, with agents on Railway, the web app on Vercel and a CI-gated test suite.","score":0.4415}]}}

